# Optional CDN / object-storage origin for models & textures (trailing slash optional).
# When set at build time, dist omits public/assets/models and textures so
# GitHub Pages stays small — assets must still exist in git (or on the CDN).
#
# Local: leave unset (serves from /assets via Vite).
#
# jsDelivr (GitHub mirror) — base must end at public/ so paths become
#   …/public/assets/models/...
# VITE_ASSET_BASE=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/lanyuechen/pudgy-world@master/public/
#
# Prefer a commit SHA over @master for stable cache:
# VITE_ASSET_BASE=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/lanyuechen/pudgy-world@<sha>/public/
#
# Models are served as meshopt .glb (npm run convert:glb). Configs may still
# say .fbx — assetUrl rewrites to .glb at runtime.
#
# GitHub Actions: set repository variable VITE_ASSET_BASE (see deploy-pages.yml).
# VITE_ASSET_BASE=
